sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant C as Browser / agent client
    participant A as A2A endpoint (FastAPI)
    participant W as ADK workflow
    participant D as DSPy module
    participant L as LiteLLM → model

    C->>A: POST /recommendation/a2a<br/>{method: "message/stream", ...}
    A->>W: run(RecommendationRequest)
    W->>W: retrieve_candidate_items_node
    W-->>A: Event{stage: retrieve, status: running}
    A-->>C: SSE event
    W->>D: judge.judge(candidates, persona, ...)
    D->>L: ChainOfThought prompt
    L-->>D: structured output
    D-->>W: CoverageDecision
    W-->>A: Event{stage: judging, status: done}
    A-->>C: SSE event
    W->>D: ranker.rank(candidates, k=5)
    D->>L: ChainOfThought prompt
    L-->>D: structured output
    D-->>W: RankingResult
    W-->>A: Event{stage: ranking, output: ...}
    A-->>C: SSE event (final)
